              "jcr:created": "Mon Sep 10 2018 18:49:18 GMT-0400",
              "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\">Universal Cystoscopy and Protecting the Ureters with Dr. Steven McCarus</span></span></p>\n<p>Please join us for an interactive virtual educational meeting surrounding the clinical benefits and placement techniques of IRIS (infrared illumination system) stents. This meeting will be led by renowned Gynecologic surgeon, Dr. Steven McCarus, who will provide an opportunity to learn more about the mitigation of ureteral injuries with placement of lighted ureteral stents through proper cystoscopy.</p>\n",
